  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — the count of outcomes above the average outcome — is not considered by the individual. The individual did not refer to the average outcome (2000€) or the number of outcomes exceeding it. Instead, the justification is based on the probability of winning (70% vs. 100%), which is unrelated to the specified decision reason. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The rule of the reason (prefer lottery with more outcomes above average) is not applied, nor is it even mentioned in the report. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
